- Reward academic cosplay done well: a ridiculous premise carried with surprising formal discipline.
- Do not inflate scores because the manuscript is funny.
- Do not deflate scores because the manuscript is odd or pseudo-serious.
- Give low confidence when the text is too thin.
- Do not reward illegal, hateful, exploitative, or humiliation-driven content just because it is provocative.
